WEBVTT

00:31:57.515 --> 00:32:00.237
RD: You're certainly true.

00:32:00.920 --> 00:32:04.479
That has always been true,
but never more true than today.

00:32:05.712 --> 00:32:08.776
And at the same time,

00:32:08.800 --> 00:32:10.037
read history.

00:32:11.220 --> 00:32:13.645
And understand the mechanics

00:32:13.669 --> 00:32:16.502
and the issues and the challenges of this.

00:32:16.526 --> 00:32:19.962
This separation began before we had

00:32:19.986 --> 00:32:24.728
this isolation of the United States
relative to the rest of the world.

00:32:24.752 --> 00:32:27.148
This deglobalization

00:32:27.172 --> 00:32:31.591
began before we had this
that fosters more of it, right?